This campaign tests the shortest currently open bridge from the Block 206
positive H1 probability germ to a physically owned nearest-neighbor
Admissibility law. The target is not another Fourier response. It is a single
law-level map from six actual one-site M2 conditions to the H1 source and
port-free binary probability distribution.

