## Stage A: type the input before decoding it

Keep distinct:

1. the six alternative source displacements used by Block 206;
2. six simultaneous neighboring one-site M2 conditions eta;
3. the 10-component TT coefficient supplied to the action;
4. the expanded 110-term forward and actual-reverse Laurent sources; and
