If native factors are radius one but the TT coefficient enters before any eta
map, identify the exact missing supplier and the smallest positive successor
test. Do not call this a broad no-go or an axiom failure. If a bounded negative
or named-wall claim is shipped, execute repository N1-N8 discipline first.

Do not open H2 or a C32 localization campaign unless Stage C closes. Do not
amend the minimal axioms unless two complete same-input physical laws remain
after source, event, formation, covariance, and readability discriminators.
Formal obligation retirement and TOE percentages remain unchanged unless the
complete eta-to-source-to-probability bridge closes.
